+For a Git working tree with dirty tracked or untracked paths, the revision also
+binds readable file bytes and symlink targets through `dirty_content_digest`.
+Inspect `dirty_content_complete`: a false value means some dirty path could not
+be bound. A downstream effectful path still requires a clean target and its
